  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Summoned to Poseidon headquarters, Kuroki hears Ikezawa offer twenty million yen for an exclusive contract—enough to help both her mother and Muranishi—before rejecting his demand to alter her body.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "今日君がここに来たことを素直に喜んでいいよな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "アダルトビデオは君の天職だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "自分でもそれを確信してるんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "そうかもしれません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "だったら話は簡単だ。うちと専属契約しなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "契約金は二千万円。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "それだけあればお母さんも安心して暮らせる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "助けたい人間も救えるんじゃないか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "できません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "これが私らしい在り方なんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "うちの美学とは合わないんだよ。いいからすぐに剃りなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "全員が幸せになれる提案だよ、これは。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "今日君がここに来たことを素直に喜んでいいよな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can I take your coming here today as good news?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "アダルトビデオは君の天職だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Adult video is your true calling.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "自分でもそれを確信してるんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are convinced of that yourself, aren't you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "そうかもしれません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Perhaps that is true.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "だったら話は簡単だ。うちと専属契約しなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then it is a simple talk. Sign an exclusive contract with us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "契約金は二千万円。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The signing bonus is twenty million yen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "それだけあればお母さんも安心して暮らせる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With that much money, your mother can live with peace of mind too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "助けたい人間も救えるんじゃないか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And couldn't you also rescue the person you want to save?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "できません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I cannot do that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "これが私らしい在り方なんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is my authentic way of being.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "うちの美学とは合わないんだよ。いいからすぐに剃りなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It does not fit our aesthetic. Just do as I say and shave right away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "全員が幸せになれる提案だよ、これは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is a proposal that makes everyone happy.'",
      "gap": 0.65
